		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-05-22T04:46:31Z",
			"File": ["⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀", 20, 1],
			"Message": "chore(license): relicense project under CC0 1.0 Universal\n\n- Replaces Land Public License v1.0 with CC0 1.0 Universal public domain dedication\n- Removes copyleft requirements and simplifies contribution/usage terms\n- Aligns with project goals of maximum permissiveness for community adoption\n- Retains copyright notice but waives all exclusive rights under copyright law\n- Enables unrestricted use/modification/distribution of Land codebase\n- Maintains project attribution while removing license compatibility concerns\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: This fundamentally changes licensing terms from reciprocal copyleft (LPL) to public domain dedication. All previous LPL obligations are removed.",
			"SHA": "3e531f4c41d46f9f488a73522201d623657da9c2"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Auto",
			"Date": "2025-05-22T00:42:16Z",
			"File": ["⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀", 20, 1],
			"Message": "",
			"SHA": "5e434ba93902349f44099107e147025a1a9ecb5d"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Auto",
			"Date": "2025-05-21T00:42:45Z",
			"File": ["⠃⠀⠀⠀⠀", 20, 1],
			"Message": "",
			"SHA": "e1c6fef3176dadb6d8b1c17086360cc99af25629"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-05-20T18:15:32Z",
			"File": ["⡟⠀⠀⠀⠀", 20, 3],
			"Message": "docs(contributing): standardize URL casing in documentation links\n\n- Updated all `HTTPS` protocol references to lowercase `https` in CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, and README.md\n- Ensures consistency in documentation link formatting across project files\n- Addresses potential confusion from mixed-case protocol declarations while maintaining functional equivalence\n- Aligns with standard web URL conventions and improves markdown readability\n- Affects community-facing documentation without impacting core Land architecture components",
			"SHA": "b40170b509cc7e750abae9d3ad308799f0c8c761"
